OL,3,GNEWSAPeterborough Arena bids for events
OL,4,Alicence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to allow sporting events, live
OL,7,Fmusic and late night alcohol sales on
OL,8,Fpart of a former showground site are
OL,9,Fbeing considered by councillors.
OL,11,FPeterborough Arena, based at the former
OL,12,FEast of England Showground, is being
OL,13,Fconsidered for a new premises licence.
OL,15,FThe application would allow a range of
OL,16,Fentertainment including boxing, indoor
OL,17,Fsporting events, live music and plays,
OL,18,Fand alcohol sales until 02:00.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
