OL,3,GNEWSAPeterborough Arena bids for events
OL,4,Alicence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report to Peterborough City Council's
OL,7,Flicensing sub-committee said 14
OL,8,Fobjections had been raised, with
OL,9,Fconcerns focusing on noise, public
OL,10,Fnuisance and safety, with one
OL,11,Frepresentation in support.
